{"id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-oracle-numbering.md","title":"相对部分函数与有限 oracle","display":"df-oracle-numbering — 相对部分函数与有限 oracle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-oracle-numbering","aliases":["20-df-oracle-numbering"],"display":"df-oracle-numbering — 相对部分函数与有限 oracle","chapter":"3","section":"3.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"§3.2；Notation: Partial A-Computable Functions","source_pdf_pages":[89,90],"source_printed_pages":[53,54],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-machine]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-oracle-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-oracle-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-numbering — 相对部分函数与有限 oracle"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§3.2；Notation: Partial A-Computable Functions"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span><span>90</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2af550cdf8ea0be2\" href=\"?note=2af550cdf8ea0be2\" title=\"20-df-oracle-machine\">20-df-oracle-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；固定 oracle 程序编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e\">\\(M_e\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2af550cdf8ea0be2\" href=\"?note=2af550cdf8ea0be2\" title=\"20-df-oracle-machine\">20-df-oracle-machine</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{e,q}\">\\(Q_{e,q}\\)</span> 是第 e 个程序的查询状态集；配置序列在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}\\)</span> 内量化。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i=(q_i,t_i,h_i)\">\\(c_i=(q_i,t_i,h_i)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hist}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hist}\\)</span> 是下述有限正常停止历史关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{e,q}\">\\(Q_{e,q}\\)</span> 取自 oracle-machine 的查询状态表。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land |c|&gt;0\\land c_0=c_0(x)\n\\land(\\forall i&lt;|c|-1\\ c_i\\to_{M_e}^A c_{i+1})\\\\\n\\land\\exists t,h\\ [c_{|c|-1}=(0,t,h)\n\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c),\\\\\nA_\\sigma:=\\{i&lt;|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=1\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|c|\\ (q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i)&lt;|\\sigma|)],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^A:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\n\\exists e\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\\n[f(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^A(\\vec x)]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land |c|&gt;0\\land c_0=c_0(x)\n\\land(\\forall i&lt;|c|-1\\ c_i\\to_{M_e}^A c_{i+1})\\\\\n\\land\\exists t,h\\ [c_{|c|-1}=(0,t,h)\n\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c),\\\\\nA_\\sigma:=\\{i&lt;|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=1\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|c|\\ (q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i)&lt;|\\sigma|)],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^A:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\n\\exists e\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\\n[f(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^A(\\vec x)]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>停止配置的输出条件精确采用 tmcomp 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n=(0,t,h)\">\\(c_n=(0,t,h)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=|\\{j:t(j)=1\\}|\">\\(y=|\\{j:t(j)=1\\}|\\)</span>。查询数的一元块译码与停止输出计数是两个不同操作；查询格式限制不会额外限制正常停止时的读头位置。有限 oracle 不是把所有未给定位当作 0：只接受完全在其长度内的计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元输入按固定编码编译。函数 oracle 可用图编码为集合 oracle。</p>\n<p>来源：§3.2；Notation: Partial A-Computable Functions；印刷页 53, 54；PDF 第 89, 90 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-machine","status":"resolved","id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-machine","status":"resolved","id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"M_e","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{e,q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}","display":false},{"tex":"c_i=(q_i,t_i,h_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hist}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{e,q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\land |c|>0\\land c_0=c_0(x)\n\\land(\\forall i<|c|-1\\ c_i\\to_{M_e}^A c_{i+1})\\\\\n\\land\\exists t,h\\ [c_{|c|-1}=(0,t,h)\n\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c),\\\\\nA_\\sigma:=\\{i<|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=1\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land\n\\forall i<|c|\\ (q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i)<|\\sigma|)],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^A:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\n\\exists e\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\\n[f(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^A(\\vec x)]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"c_n=(0,t,h)","display":false},{"tex":"y=|\\{j:t(j)=1\\}|","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":2473,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_